card-title">专题入口</h3><div class="topic-list"> <a class="topic-item topic-item-ai" href="https://zhupite.com/categories/?category=ai#ai"> <span class="topic-main"> <span class="topic-name">AI 专题</span> <span class="topic-desc">模型、Agent 与生产力</span> </span> <span class="topic-count">64</span> </a> <a class="topic-item topic-item-sec" href="https://zhupite.com/categories/?category=sec#sec"> <span class="topic-main"> <span class="topic-name">安全研究</span> <span class="topic-desc">逆向、攻防与治理</span> </span> <span class="topic-count">255</span> </a> <a class="topic-item topic-item-tool" href="https://zhupite.com/categories/?category=tool#tool"> <span class="topic-main"> <span class="topic-name">工具箱</span> <span class="topic-desc">效率工具与开源项目</span> </span> <span class="topic-count">144</span> </a> <a class="topic-item topic-item-dev" href="https://zhupite.com/categories/?category=dev#dev"> <span class="topic-main"> <span class="topic-name">开发笔记</span> <span class="topic-desc">编程、框架与工程实践</span> </span> <span class="topic-count">330</span> </a> <a class="topic-item topic-item-travel" href="https://zhupite.com/categories/?category=travel#travel"> <span class="topic-main"> <span class="topic-name">行走记录</span> <span class="topic-desc">徒步、旅行与城市观察</span> </span> <span class="topic-count">37</span> </a> <a class="topic-item topic-item-life" href="https://zhupite.com/categories/?category=life#life"> <span class="topic-main"> <span class="topic-name">生活实践</span> <span class="topic-desc">健康、家常与日常经验</span> </span> <span class="topic-count">32</span> </a> <a class="topic-item topic-item-reads" href="https://zhupite.com/categories/?category=reads#reads"> <span class="topic-main"> <span class="topic-name">读书笔记</span> <span class="topic-desc">阅读、摘抄与书影音</span> </span> <span class="topic-count">147</span> </a> <a class="topic-item topic-item-thinking" href="https://zhupite.com/categories/?category=thinking#thinking"> <span class="topic-main"> <span class="topic-name">思考札记</span> <span class="topic-desc">认知、方法与成长</span> </span> <span class="topic-count">41</span> </a> <a class="topic-item topic-item-invest" href="https://zhupite.com/categories/?category=invest#invest"> <span class="topic-main"> <span class="topic-name">投资认知</span> <span class="topic-desc">资产配置、市场与风险</span> </span> <span class="topic-count">6</span> </a></div></div></aside></div></div><!-- /main-wrapper --><footer class="site-footer-modern"><div class="footer-container"><div class="footer-info"><div class="footer-brand"> <span class="brand-avatar small">Z</span> <span class="footer-brand-name">朱皮特的烂笔头</span></div><p class="footer-desc">你不必等到非常厉害，才敢开始；你需要开始，才会变得非常厉害！</p><div class="footer-links"> <span>&copy; 2026</span> <span title="zhupite">zhupite</span> <span>总访问 <span id="busuanzi_value_site_pv">...</span></span></div></div><div class="footer-social"> <a href="https://github.com/bigsinger" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub"> <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"/><path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"/></svg> </a> <a href="https://zhupite.com/feed.xml" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="RSS"> <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 11a9 9 0 0 1 9 9"/><path d="M4 4a16 16 0 0 1 16 16"/><circle cx="5" cy="19" r="1"/></svg> </a> <a href="mailto:pushebp#163.com" aria-label="Email"> <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7"/><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/></svg> </a></div></div></footer><div class="tools-wrapper"> <a class="gotop" href="#" title="回到顶部"> <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline> </svg> </a></div><!-- Mobile TOC floating button --> <button class="toc-mobile-btn" id="tocMobileBtn" aria-label="打开文章目录" aria-controls="tocMobileOverlay" aria-expanded="false" type="button"> <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="4" y1="6" x2="20" y2="6"></line><line x1="4" y1="12" x2="20" y2="12"></line><line x1="4" y1="18" x2="20" y2="18"></line> </svg> </button> <!-- Mobile TOC overlay — drawer from bottom --><div class="toc-mobile-overlay" id="tocMobileOverlay" aria-hidden="true"><div class="toc-mobile-drawer"><div class="toc-drawer-header"> <span class="toc-drawer-title"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px"><line x1="4" y1="6" x2="20" y2="6"></line><line x1="4" y1="12" x2="20" y2="12"></line><line x1="4" y1="18" x2="20" y2="18"></line></svg>文章目录</span> <button class="toc-drawer-close" id="tocDrawerClose" aria-label="关闭" type="button">✕</button></div><div class="toc-drawer-body"><ul class="toc-list" id="toc-mobile-list"></ul></div></div></div></body></html>
